WEBVTT

00:02:25.391 --> 00:02:30.813
My father denied that he was my father
because of pressure from his family.

00:02:31.439 --> 00:02:35.693
But luckily, my mother's parents
decided to raise me.

00:02:36.903 --> 00:02:39.739
Even so, it was hard

00:02:39.780 --> 00:02:43.993
as I was constantly treated as trash
by the rest of my community.

00:02:44.744 --> 00:02:48.289
So when I was five years old,
my grandparents,

00:02:48.331 --> 00:02:50.416
especially my grandmother,

00:02:50.458 --> 00:02:53.169
she decided that it was
in my best interest

00:02:53.211 --> 00:02:56.964
that I go to the capital of Suriname
to get an education,

00:02:56.964 --> 00:02:58.883
to make something of my life.